  "id": "potato-and-cheese-pierogi",
  "name": "Potato and Cheese Pierogi",
  "subtitle": "Wonton-wrapped potato dumplings with bacon and chives",
  "description": "A savory potato and farmer’s cheese filling is folded into wonton wrappers, simmered, and finished with bacon, sour cream, and chives.",
